# CQ: Who owns an account? (an account is related to the person who owns it)
# Authored from the banking scope (PLAN.md), not from FIBEN's gold questions.
PREFIX fiben: <https://example.org/fiben/voc#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
ASK { ?p rdfs:domain fiben:FinancialServiceAccount ; rdfs:range fiben:Person . FILTER(?p = fiben:isOwnedBy) }
